{"4963970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dead Broke", "steam_appid": 4963970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Money is your life. Your ammo. Your only way out.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You pawned your soul to the casino of hell, and now you work as a collector to buy it back. Descend into the halls, shoot, gamble, and survive: in <i>Dead Broke</i>, every bullet you fire spends money, every coin you grab is life, and every bet can save you or ruin you. One single Wallet for everything. And the House always wins... until you stop owing it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dead Broke</i> is a fast-paced action arena roguelite with a twist: there's no health bar. Just your money, bleeding out with every shot and every hit. Manage your economy while you dodge hordes of debtors, bosses that attack your wallet, and a casino that never wants you to leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A single Wallet:</strong> life, ammo, and currency are the same thing. Shooting costs. Taking damage costs. Surviving is a money problem.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>13 characters</strong>, each with a rule that breaks the game: the Widow who starts in debt, the Forger who shoots almost for free, the Twins with a double wallet, and more to unlock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20+ weapons and 40+ items</strong> with hidden synergies that reward experimentation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Parlor:</strong> between rounds, bet with the Broker, buy from the Shopkeeper, and take your chances with the Lender... if you dare read the fine print.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 different endings:</strong> how you reach the House —rich, broke, or through the secret route— decides your fate. No menus: the way you play is your choice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local co-op for up to 4 players</strong> with a shared wallet: survive together or go broke together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scaling difficulty, a daily challenge, and dozens of achievements</strong> to master the casino.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the Parlor. Debt never sleeps.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Money is your life. Your ammo. Your only way out.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You pawned your soul to the casino of hell, and now you work as a collector to buy it back. Descend into the halls, shoot, gamble, and survive: in <i>Dead Broke</i>, every bullet you fire spends money, every coin you grab is life, and every bet can save you or ruin you. One single Wallet for everything. And the House always wins... until you stop owing it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dead Broke</i> is a fast-paced action arena roguelite with a twist: there's no health bar. Just your money, bleeding out with every shot and every hit. Manage your economy while you dodge hordes of debtors, bosses that attack your wallet, and a casino that never wants you to leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A single Wallet:</strong> life, ammo, and currency are the same thing. Shooting costs. Taking damage costs. Surviving is a money problem.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>13 characters</strong>, each with a rule that breaks the game: the Widow who starts in debt, the Forger who shoots almost for free, the Twins with a double wallet, and more to unlock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20+ weapons and 40+ items</strong> with hidden synergies that reward experimentation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Parlor:</strong> between rounds, bet with the Broker, buy from the Shopkeeper, and take your chances with the Lender... if you dare read the fine print.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 different endings:</strong> how you reach the House —rich, broke, or through the secret route— decides your fate. No menus: the way you play is your choice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local co-op for up to 4 players</strong> with a shared wallet: survive together or go broke together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scaling difficulty, a daily challenge, and dozens of achievements</strong> to master the casino.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the Parlor. Debt never sleeps.</strong></p>", "short_description": "An arena roguelite where money is your life, your ammo, and your currency. Shoot, gamble, and survive in a casino from hell: every bullet costs, every coin saves you. 13 characters, 5 endings, and local co-op. The House always wins... until you stop owing it.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4963970/594c9cd5a73f4ea18d08d29b56365b9370c42caf/header.jpg?t=1786374446", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4963970/84f091e9aa1648d85c260414c964de32662eceee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786374446", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4963970/84f091e9aa1648d85c260414c964de32662eceee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786374446", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Versión del SO: Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Procesador: Intel Core i3 / AMD Ryzen 3 o superior<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4096 MB MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> cualquier GPU con soporte OpenGL 3.3 / Vulkan (ej. Intel HD 4000 o superior)<br></li><li><strong>Stor